{title: Cante Al Señor}
{artist: Ingrid Rosario}
{composer: Darlene Zschech e Ingrid Rosario}
{key: A}
{source: https://www.cifraclub.com/ingrid-rosario/cante-al-seor/}

{start_of_verse}
[A]         [E]
Mi cristo, mi rey
[F#m]     [E]     [D]
Nadie es como Tu
      [A]      [D]      [A]
Toda mi vida quiero exaltar
               [G]  [D]    [E]
Las maravillas de Tu amor
[A]      [E]
Consuelo, refugio
[F#m]        [E]        [D]
Torre de fuerza y poder
        [A]  [D]            [A]
Todo mi ser, lo que yo soy
            [G]  [D]   [E]
Nunca cese de adorar
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Estribillo}
 [A]       [F#m]        [D]       [E]
Cante al señor toda la creación
[A]        [F#m]        [D]          [E]
Honra y poder majestad sean al rey
[F#m]      [D]          [A]    [E]
Montes caeran y el mar rugirá
   [E]     [D]      [E]
Al sonar de su nombre
 [A]        [F#m]       [D]         [E]
Canto con gozo al mirar tu poder
 [A]            [F#m]    [D]       [E]
Por siempre yo te amare y dire
 [F#m]     [D]         [A]        [E]
 Incomparables promesas me das señor
      [F#m]     [D]         [A]        [E]       [A]
 Incomparables promesas me das Señor
{end_of_chorus}
